igation**: Seamless navigation between related documents via links  \n✅ **Section Collapsing**: Interactive content sections with clear indicators and link access control  \n✅ **Knowledge Graph**: Visual representation of all documents with interactive nodes and zoom controls  \n✅ **State Preservation**: Settings persist across tab switches and page reloads  \n✅ **Favorites System**: Local storage with real-time counts and filter-resistant markers  \n✅ **User Feedback**: Clear prompts and messages for all edge cases  "
